        "answer": {
          "short": "Rectangle: $8\\pi\\text{ cm}\\times10\\text{ cm}$. Each circle: radius $4\\text{ cm}$.",
          "worked": "The rectangle's length is the circumference of a circular end:\n$$\\begin{align*}C&=2\\pi r\\\\C&=2\\pi(4)\\\\C&=8\\pi\\text{ cm}.\\end{align*}$$\nIts width is the cylinder's height, $10\\text{ cm}$. Each circle has radius $4\\text{ cm}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
              "id": "p20-q1-a-labelled-net",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"source page 20 p20-q1-a-labelled-net\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,line width=0.8pt,draw=black,text=black,every node/.style={font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont}]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\draw (0,0) rectangle (3,1.8);\n\\draw (1.5,2.25) circle (0.45);\n\\draw (1.5,-0.45) circle (0.45);\n\\fill (1.5,-0.45) circle (1pt);\n\\draw[->,line width=0.4pt] (1.5,-0.45)--(1.95,-0.45);\n\\node[right] at (2.1,-0.45) {$4\\text{ cm}$};\n\\draw[<->,line width=0.4pt] (0,1.55)--(3,1.55) node[midway,below] {$8\\pi\\text{ cm}$};\n\\draw[<->,line width=0.4pt] (3.3,0)--(3.3,1.8) node[midway,right] {$10\\text{ cm}$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
              "src": null,
              "widthMm": 55,
              "alt": "Mathematical diagram",
              "overlayOf": null,
              "transparent": false,
              "axes": null,
              "spec": {
                "sourcePage": 20,
                "sourceRegion": "Question 1 blank net",
                "description": "Completed connected net with the rectangle's circumference and height dimensions and one circular radius labelled.",
                "mathematics": "Rectangle 8π cm by 10 cm; congruent circles of radius 4 cm.",
                "answerVisibility": "Solution only."
              },
              "derived": false,
              "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 0,
        "responseSpace": "scaffold"
